TextRoom keyboard shortcuts:

F1 - Help screen
F11 - Fullscreen on/off
Escape - Quit or exit fullscreen (depends on current active window state)
Alt+H - About
Alt+M - Minimize TextRoom
Alt+Q - Quit

Alt+N - New
Alt+O - Open
Alt+S - Save
Alt+Shift+S - Save As

Alt+X - Cut
Alt+C - Copy
Alt+V - Paste
Alt+A - Select All
Alt+Z - Undo (Alt+Shift+Z to Redo)
Alt+T - Indent first lines (useful due to unresolved bug)
Shift+F4 - Go back to cursor position
Alt+F - Find
F3 - Find Next
Shift+F3 - Find previous

Alt+D - Show date and time in statusbar
Alt+L - Show statistics in statusbar
Alt+U - Options
